hor":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":158698,"discussion_content":"棒","content_length":1,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1580616094,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1225224,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/0.png","nickname":"尔东橙","note":"","ucode":"0B013A49BC18DA","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":5236,"discussion_content":"感谢老师，老师的专栏值得多读","content_length":14,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1566103135,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":175215,"user_name":"猴哥一一 cium","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1254801,"ip_address":"","ucode":"38EC64F8D1A0B4","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/25/91/46600294.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1580617589,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100027701,"comment_content":"专栏买了好久都没看。\n因为一直对一个请求如何被处理，以及servlet规范到底怎么约束了容器和热门的spring系框架的，工作中又要用到boot，越来越多，心中疑惑成了阻碍。\n\n最近抽时间，先读完了感兴趣的（因为不明白）Http透视课程，\n然后看tomcat课的开篇就提到servlet（工作这几年一直对它念念不忘），很开心，坚持读了一遍。\n\n抛去对源码的研究，心中依然有太多疑惑，但更多的是无从问起，因为发现很多疑惑在操作系统原理，tcp等相关知识上…\n\n所以最近想补一补这方面的知识，开工之后打算买一本&lt;uninx环境高级编程&gt;看一看有哪些内容。\n\n另外，又觉的，从操作系统开干，学习战线又显得太长，工作中貌似有些不切实际。所以想咨询下，我该如何对待操作系统，tcp这些底层原理呢？目前想缓解我在认识http，tomcat过程中的疑惑，需要学到什么程度呢？或者有什么样的学习思路推荐？\n\n感谢李哥的专栏！","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":171746,"user_nam